# Text files are stored and checked out with LF everywhere (Windows too): the scripts need it and
# the tests compare reference files byte for byte.
* text=auto eol=lf
# Binary data.
*.png binary
*.gz binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.ttc binary
*.mp3 binary
*.ogg binary
*.wav binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.spv binary
*.blend binary
*.glb binary
# The engine's data packs (Docs/Assets.md) and the record serializer's binary fixtures. A pack's diff
# is its dump once the clone has run, from the repo's root (Docs/Assets.md, "Reviewing packs"):
#   git config diff.pak.textconv engine/Tools/Packer/textconv.sh
*.pak binary diff=pak
*.rec binary
# Kept exactly as the old game has it (CRLF).
/old-game/classes/newc/Bruiser.txt -text
